  "summary": "Malicious code in manager-thedate (npm)",
  "details": "The package's main entry (index.js) exports a value read from an OpenSSL AES-encrypted blob (apps/docs/app/des.db, \"Salted__\" header) via apps/docs/app/theta.js, exposing it as desKey. The package is otherwise a Next.js/turbo monorepo template with no install hooks, no network calls, and no other executable payload. The encrypted blob is shipped as a key inside a package described as a \"Theta Data API\" developer platform; no code in the package decrypts or uses it. No network IOC was observed.",
